```mdl
verdict DiagramKind: No DiagramKind type exists.
  status: missing
  note: The extension takes the first token of the source as a label and never enumerates kinds; searched `src/`.
```

```mdl
verdict DiagramTheme: No DiagramTheme type exists; themes pass through MermaidConfig.
  status: missing
  note: The code picks `dark` or `neutral` and accepts mermaid's `theme` option; the five literals appear only as a story control.
```

```mdl
verdict RenderResult: No RenderResult type exists.
  status: missing
  note: The widget stores mermaid's `result.svg` in `_svg`; there is no declared type with svg and id.
```

```mdl
verdict RenderError: No RenderError type exists.
  status: missing
  note: Errors are stored as `String(err)` in `_error`, without the source.
```

```mdl
verdict MermaidWidget: The widget renders the SVG with a type label, or the error text.
  status: done
  evidence: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-mermaid/src/extensions/mermaid-extension.ts#MermaidWidget]
  tests: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-mermaid/src/extensions/mermaid.stories.tsx]
  note: It takes a full `MermaidConfig` instead of a `darkMode` boolean.
```

```mdl
verdict renderDiagram: Rendering is a private widget method, not an operation, with no typed errors.
  status: diverged
  evidence: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-mermaid/src/extensions/mermaid-extension.ts#MermaidWidget]
  note: |
    `MermaidWidget.render` calls `Mermaid.parse` then `Mermaid.render` and catches everything into one
    string; there is no `ParseError`/`RenderError` split and no invocable op.
```

